<a href="/planning#safety-stock">Back to planning</a>
<h1>Review safety stock</h1>
<p><%= result.code %> · <%= result.location %></p>
<p>For <%= result.serviceLevel %>% coverage, keep <strong><%= result.units %> units</strong> of safety stock. The current setting is <%= result.current==null?'unset':result.current+' units' %>.</p>
<p>StockChief measured <%= result.windows %> fully stocked periods of <%= result.lead %> days in the last 180 days. Mean sales were <%= result.mean %> units. Sales at your chosen coverage level were <%= result.percentile %> units. Periods with a stockout are excluded.</p>
<% if(result.assumedLead){ %><p>This estimate uses the default supplier lead time of <%= result.lead %> days.</p><% } %>
<form method="post" action="/planning/safety-stock"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
<% for(const key of ['skuId','locationId','serviceLevel','digest']){ %><input type="hidden" name="<%= key %>" value="<%= result[key] %>"><% } %>
<button class="rm-btn">Approve <%= result.units %> units</button></form>
